scaffold_loadbalancer_sslciphersuite filters
name; Resolve the named cipher suite only
beneath the annotated load balancer.
conflicts: none
open gaps: none
Live Load Balancer work requests report
`CreateCipherSuite`, `UpdateCipherSuite`, and
`DeleteCipherSuite`; the runtime accepts those
observed operation names as well as the SDK's
SSLCipherSuite spellings.
`ACCEPTED` and `IN_PROGRESS` remain pending,
`SUCCEEDED` transitions to a child readback, and
failed work requests retain actionable async
status.
The child has no independent OCI OCID. Runtime
identity is the annotated load balancer plus
immutable cipher-suite `name`; only `ciphers`
update.
end note
